Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 19:09:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ALMOVA colors in the app theme

The navy and the neon green of the site and the app icon replace the
wger blue and red. The green is only the seed of the accent: as is, the
neon has a contrast of 1.3 on white, and the app writes some labels in
the accent color, so the scheme picks a readable tone of it. The theme
test checks the brand navy and a contrast of at least 4.5 for the
primary and accent colors in light and dark mode. The store screenshots
are rendered again with the new colors.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VRSTuUkoebWWM2DLbPZAvR
